{"ref":"BDB, אֵסוּר","hw":"אֵסוּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵסוּר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Judges 15:14\" href=\"/Judges.15.14\">Ju 15:14</a></sup> <strong>band, bond (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱסוּר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܣܘܽܪܳܐ</span>; on the form v. Ges<sup>§ 84 a 12. R.</sup><strong>)</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲסוּרָיו</span>, of Samson <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:14\" href=\"/Judges.15.14\">Ju 15:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲסוּרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:26\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.26\">Ec 7:26</a> of hands of evil woman; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית הָאֵסוּר</span> = prison <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.15\">Je 37:15</a>.","next":"BDB, אָסִיר","prev":"BDB, אָסַר"}